+Summary of changes:
+
+1. **`src/_pytest/main.py`** — Added `"--co"` as an alias to the `--collectonly`/`--collect-only` option in the `collect` group. Because a real single-character flag (like `-c`) is already taken by the configuration-file option, `--co` is the shortest unambiguous alias. `argparse` (with `allow_abbrev=False`) will now accept `--co`, and the `dest` is unchanged (`collectonly`), so all existing code paths (`config.option.collectonly`, `getoption("collectonly")`) continue to work.
